          "text": "import sys\nfrom math import isqrt\n\ndef main():\n    n, m = map(int, sys.stdin.buffer.read().split())\n    if n <= m:\n        print(n)\n        return\n\n    remaining = n - m\n    k = (isqrt(8 * remaining + 1) - 1) // 2\n    if k * (k + 1) // 2 < remaining:\n        k += 1\n    print(m + k)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()",
